{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The &quot;Supporter DLC&quot; adds some customization options for your character in-game. It is <u><strong>completely optional</strong></u> and <u><strong>purely cosmetic!</strong></u>\u00a0This is for those that enjoyed Bonerooms and want to support me - the developer!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you purchased Bonerooms before it became free, you've already supported me! You should have access to this DLC already, free of charge!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This DLC grants access to the Cosmetics menu in match lobbies, which will allow you to choose from a small selection of hats, as well as a color picker to customize your suit color (suit colors do not apply to Red vs. Blue).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The hat selection includes:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Leather Cowboy Hat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Velvet Cowboy Hat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&quot;Bonerooms&quot; Cap</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fez</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Hangover</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Lil' Buddy</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Sheriff Buddy</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Top Hat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Toppest Hat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Spooky Skull</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Sweet Shades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Disguise Glasses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Googly Eyes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Axe Boi Plush</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3369590?t=1747233286","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3369590?t=1747233286","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3369590/799c2161f729fb063ce065032